<title>DENMARK: Moeller 1996 profits rise.</title>
<headline>Moeller 1996 profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net result		   2,223  vs  1,805</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result	     3,492  vs  2,793</p>
<p> Group net turnover		 33,013 vs 28,518</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (percent) D/S Svendborg   115 vs 90</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (percent) D/S 1912	   75 vs 60</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are for the Danish A.P. Moeller group's two listed firms A/S Dampskibsselskabet Svendborg and Dampskibsselskabet af 1912 A/S plus activities in partnership (tankers, liners, oil &amp; gas activity). It said in a statement that it expected 1997 to show further improved profits in its shipping business.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
